# The walk scripts/duo verify films: the app's screens moving into each other by toolbar, tab, row
# and back, then with a call on. Each part opens the app afresh, so a step that sticks
# can't hide the rest.
shoot call
tap tasks-button
shoot tasks
tap Working
shoot working
tap voice-settings-button
shoot settings
tap tasks-button
shoot tasks-again
tap voice-settings-button
tap tasks-button
launch hexvoice:///?tasks
tap project-row
shoot project
tap back
tap tasks-search
type tasks-search-field voice
shoot searching
launch hexvoice:///
tap calls-button
shoot calls
launch hexvoice:///?demo=call
shoot call-live
tap tasks-button
shoot tasks-on-call
tap voice-settings-button
shoot settings-on-call
tap tasks-button
